<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 14038 0 R/Alt(Four flip-flops in a row, s_q[0] to s_q[3], each output feeding the D input of the next one. The output of s_q[3] returns through an inverter to the D input of s_q[0]. Each flip-flop output also goes down to a decoder from 4 to 8 bits, whose output is q_o of 8 bits.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[56]/Pg 29379 0 R>>
