24861 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 24862 0 R/Alt(Circuit. Two flip-flops in a row form the reset synchronizer: the first has its D input tied to 1, the second drives the net rst_sync_n. rst_ni from the pin drives the reset inputs of both and the 1-input of a multiplexer, whose 0-input is rst_sync_n and whose select input is test_mode_i. The multiplexer output rst_n drives the reset inputs of a block labeled 21 flip-flops of bs_reg.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[71]/Pg 29502 0 R>>
endobj
